# Discord Bot Credentials (Guild-only)
DISCORD_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here
DISCORD_APPLICATION_ID=your_application_id_here
DISCORD_GUILD_ID=your_guild_id_here

# PostgreSQL connection string: provision a dedicated LOGIN role (e.g. tokenmunchers_bot)
# inheriting the NOLOGIN role tokenmunchers_discord_reader. Do not use service_role or the NOLOGIN reader directly.
#
# Connection Modes (port 5432):
# - Direct connection: db.<project-ref>.supabase.co:5432 with username tokenmunchers_bot. Requires IPv6 connectivity or IPv4 add-on.
# - Shared session pooler: aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:5432 with username tokenmunchers_bot.<project-ref>.
#   Use this for IPv4-only or unrouted IPv6 hosts (prevents ENETUNREACH). Look up the exact pooler host in the Supabase
#   dashboard (Connect -> Session pooler); do not derive it from region.
# - Prepared statements (prepare: true) are supported on port 5432 in both direct and session pooler modes.
# - Transaction pooler (port 6543) is NOT supported because it does not support prepared statements.
# Reference: https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres
#
# TLS Verification:
# The bot automatically bundles the official Supabase Root CA (certs/supabase-prod-ca.crt)
# and enforces TLS chain and hostname verification directly in code (rejectUnauthorized: true).
# Using ?sslmode=verify-full in DATABASE_URL is standard and fully compatible.
# - Never disable TLS or use insecure options (no rejectUnauthorized: false or sslmode=require).
# - Never set NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0.
# - Do not set NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS in .env (Node --env-file does not load it before TLS initialization).
# Direct connection example:
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://tokenmunchers_bot:your_secure_password@db.your-project.supabase.co:5432/postgres?sslmode=verify-full
# Session pooler example (for IPv4-only / unrouted IPv6 environments):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://tokenmunchers_bot.your-project:your_secure_password@aws-0-us-east-2.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres?sslmode=verify-full
# Optional: URL to link embed title to the web dashboard (must be http:// or https://)
# DASHBOARD_URL=https://tokenmunchers.example.com
